# Platform Chart

This tree is Community Edition platform only.

- Do not add example toggles (`*.enabled` for a demo name) to `values.yaml`. Local kind overlays live in `profiles/values-local.yaml`, not in this chart.
- Do not seed demo databases, collections, prompts, or eval datasets here. Platform init may create platform-owned DBs only (e.g. `aegra`, `langfuse`).
- Do not point MCP, NeMo, Langfuse, or Aegra defaults at a specific example's database, collection, project id, or product copy.
- Do not import or template from `examples/`.
- New knobs get generic defaults. Example-specific values belong in `examples/<name>/chart/`. Customer SaaS MCP registers via `mcp.extraBackends: []` (empty default) — do not add `servicenow` (or any vendor) as a chart default or Deployment.
- Do not add `| default "*.localhost"`, `dev-key`, fixture tenants, or pytest-only Services/Routes so `tests/` pass. Tests adapt via env; kind hosts live in `profiles/values-local.yaml` (see `tests-do-not-shape-platform.mdc`).
- Do not inline Python in templates. Prefer images; otherwise `files/` + `.Files.Get` (see `helm-python-packaging.mdc`).

Customer production installs this chart with no `examples/` release.
